@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Hiragino Sans"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam rectangleRoundCorner 8
rectangle "コンパイル済み GFB\n+ 検証済みソースマップ" as gfb
rectangle "シナリオ (TOON)\natMs 付きのアクション" as sc
rectangle "ghostsim" as sim
rectangle "ネイティブのフレーム付きランナー\n(通常の入力プログラム)\nKeyboardMapper + ScanDriver" as nat
rectangle "Rust/WASM 制御ホスト\n(センサ、仮想アクチュエータ、\n認証済み区間、Solar)" as wasm
rectangle "ポータブルな Rust\n評価コア" as core
rectangle "GhostFlow/scenario-result-v1\n(TOON または JSON)" as res
gfb --> sim
sc --> sim
sim --> nat
sim --> wasm
nat --> core
wasm --> core
sim --> res
note bottom of core : 物理デバイスのドライバは開かない
@enduml
